.env

# Uploaded resumes are transient — delete_upload() (file_handler.py) removes
# them from disk right after text extraction, but nothing should ever commit
# whatever happens to be sitting here mid-request either. Keep the folder
# itself (.gitkeep) so UPLOAD_FOLDER exists on a fresh clone.
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep

.venv/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc